# .gitignore (repository root) -- CUSTOMER-FACING DISTRIBUTION
#
# Real gap found live, 2026-08-30: the publish pipeline had no .gitignore
# at all in this repo until this file existed -- meaning a customer's own
# terraform.tfvars (Linode API token, root_pass) or *.tfstate (which can
# contain sensitive values in plan output) had no protection against
# being accidentally committed. Mirrors the dev repo's own .gitignore,
# trimmed to what's actually relevant here (no Python source ships in
# this repo, so no __pycache__/venv/pytest-cache entries needed).
#
# Author: Sandip Gangdhar (https://github.com/sandipgangdhar)
# (c) Linode-NAT-Gateway (LNG) | Developed by Sandip Gangdhar | 2026

# Terraform
**/.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars
!terraform.tfvars.example
crash.log
crash.*.log
.terraformrc
terraform.rc

# Acceptance-test suite: keep the template (config.example.yaml), ignore
# the real one -- it carries live SSH paths and credentials.
acceptance-tests/config.yaml

# Editors / OS
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
